{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105332","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105332/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105332/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105332/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105332","id":2990806562,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6SXuU6","number":105332,"title":"Add GridMap octant related queries and tests","user":{"login":"smix8","id":52464204,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyNDY0MjA0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52464204?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8","html_url":"https://github.com/smix8","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","color":"aaccff","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":283518733,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyODM1MTg3MzM=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/usability","name":"usability","color":"447744","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":3240950060,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMjQwOTUwMDYw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/performance","name":"performance","color":"447777","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2025-04-12T23:52:19Z","updated_at":"2026-04-07T16:44:54Z","closed_at":"2025-11-08T23:20:28Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/105332","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105332","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105332.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105332.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"Adds GridMap octant queries.\r\n\r\nRequires https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105329 to be merged first.\r\n\r\nAdds octant query functions as a performance alternative to the existing cell functions.\r\n\r\nE.g. when only a few cells for some specific octants are needed, e.g. inside some AABB bounds, and not all the cells of the entire GridMap which creates potentially a slow array with thousands of entries.\r\n\r\n`TypedArray[Vector3i] get_used_octants()`\r\nReturns the octant coordinates as Vector3i of all octants that have at least 1 cell in use.\r\n\r\n`TypedArray[Vector3i] get_used_octants_by_item( p_item: int)`\r\nReturns the used octant coordinates of all octants that have at least 1 cell with the specific cell item in use.\r\n\r\n`TypedArray[Vector3i] get_used_cells_in_octant(p_octant_coords: Vector3i)`\r\nReturns the used cell coordinates of all the cells inside the specific octant coordinate.\r\n\r\n`TypedArray[Vector3i] get_used_cells_in_octant_by_item(p_octant_coords: Vector3i, p_item: int)`\r\nReturns the used cell coordinates of all the cells inside the specific octant coordinate that have the specific cell item in use.\r\n\r\n`TypedArray[Vector3i] get_used_octants_in_bounds(p_bounds: AABB)`\r\nReturns the used octant coordinates of all octants that have at least 1 cell used with the specific local bounds.\r\n\r\n`Vector3i get_octant_coords_from_cell_coords(p_cell_coords: Vector3i)`\r\nScript helper to convert cell coordinate to octant coordinate for the octant related query functions.\r\n\r\n<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch in priority.\r\n\r\nRelevant fixes are cherry-picked for stable branches as needed by maintainers.\r\n\r\nTo speed up the contribution process and avoid CI errors, please set up pre-commit hooks locally:\r\nhttps://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/contributing/development/code_style_guidelines.html\r\n-->\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"smix8","id":52464204,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyNDY0MjA0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52464204?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8","html_url":"https://github.com/smix8","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105332/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105332/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}